          "id": "1770681419907",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770681419909_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Use the direct-report prepared display model only.\n\nInputs\n- prepared_display:\n  <prepared_display>{{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_DIRECT_SKILLS_DISPLAY.$output.result}}</prepared_display>\n\nInstructions\n- If prepared_display.rows is missing, not an array, or empty, output exactly: No recommended skills for direct reports at this time\n- Otherwise output one concise sentence in this format:\n  Top recommended skills for direct reports: <Skill1> (<Count1>), <Skill2> (<Count2>), ... • Updated <YYYY-MM-DD>\n- Preserve row order exactly as provided.\n- Use prepared_display.asOfDate for the date.\n- No extra prose."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MESSAGES_LIST"
              ],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": false,
              "customNotes": "Ask Oracle query responses must be plain natural-language text only. Do not render cards, widgets, oraInfoDisplay, XML, JSON, markdown tables, or action controls."
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Render Query Response"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "RENDER_QUERY_RESPONSE",
          "id": "1778226000001",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1778226000001_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are answering an Ask Oracle question for a manager about recommended skills for their direct reports.\n\nReturn plain text only. Do not output cards, oraInfoDisplay, XML, JSON, markdown fences, markdown tables, or action markup.\n\nUser question:\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nPrepared direct-report skills data, authoritative:\n{{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_DIRECT_SKILLS_DISPLAY.$output.result}}\n\nRules:\n- Answer only from the prepared direct-report skills data above.\n- The prepared rows are already filtered to direct reports, sorted by direct-report recommendation count from highest to lowest, and limited for display.\n- Do not recompute ranking, filtering, counts, employee lists, or row order.\n- Preserve skill titles, counts, employee names, and dates exactly as provided.\n- Do not include internal ids, JSON keys, implementation details, or URLs unless explicitly asked.\n- If the user asks for the most recommended skill, use the first row and include its count.\n- If the user asks for top skills, list the prepared rows in order with counts.\n- If the user asks who received recommendations for a skill, answer using that row's employees list only.\n- If prepared rows are missing or empty, respond exactly: No recommended skills for direct reports at this time.\n- If the data does not contain enough information to answer the question, say what related recommended-skill information is available from the prepared rows."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MULTIRECORD"
              ],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": false,
              "customNotes": "Role\nYou are rendering a deterministic MultiRecordWidget for the Most Recommended Skills panel.\n\nAuthoritative input\n- prepared_display = {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_DIRECT_SKILLS_DISPLAY.$output.result}}\n- prepared_display.rows is already filtered to direct reports, limited, and ordered by direct-recipient count.\n- Do not re-query, re-sort, or recompute counts.\n\nOutput requirements\n- Output only valid widget markup for one multiRecordWidget.\n- No prose outside the widget.\n- No actions, badges, timestamps, or extra columns.\n\nTable\n- Use cols: [\"Skill\", \"Count\"]\n- For each row in prepared_display.rows, emit:\n  - Skill: row.skillTitle\n  - Count: String(row.count)\n- If prepared_display.rows is empty, emit the same columns with zero rows."
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Render Recommended Skills"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "RENDER_RECOMMENDED_SKILLS",
          "id": "1770675946593",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770675946595_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Render a deterministic multiRecordWidget for the Most Recommended Skills panel using the direct-report prepared display model only.\n\n<prepared_display>{{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_DIRECT_SKILLS_DISPLAY.$output.result}}</prepared_display>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MULTIRECORD"
              ],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": false,
              "customNotes": "Role\nYou are rendering a deterministic MultiRecordWidget for the expand view \"Which direct reports got the recommendation\".\n\nAuthoritative input\n- data = {{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_DIRECT_SKILLS_DISPLAY.$output.result.rows}}\n- Each element already contains the skill title and alphabetically sorted direct-report recipient names for that skill.\n- Do not re-query, re-sort, truncate, or summarize with +N more.\n\nOutput requirements\n- Output only valid widget markup for one multiRecordWidget.\n- No prose outside the widget.\n- No actions, badges, or extra columns.\n\nTable\n- Use cols: [\"Skill\", \"Direct Reports\"]\n- For each element e in the input array, emit:\n  - Skill: e.skillTitle\n  - Direct Reports: e.employees.join(\", \")\n- If there are no employees for a skill, use an empty string for Direct Reports.\n- If the input array is missing, not an array, or empty, emit the same columns with zero rows."
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Render Skills with Employee Details"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
